   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "weight cache daemons  rank 0..N\n- load from checkpoint, own world group\n- warmup: in-place FlashInfer autotune\n- serve  UDS: get_state/get_memory/seed/release\n- D2D listener (--seed-listen-* + token)",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
